      "message": "login is the same between intellij and android studio.\nct4as is a plugin targeting only AS.\n\nThe iml files you see with \"-as\" are for a different reason.\nIf you develop the plugins within the AS tree, the\ndependencies are source module versus when we\ndevelop against IJ and are resolved through an SDK setting.\n\nSo we have:\n\nctcore/cloud-tools-core    : used when developing IJ\nctcore/cloud-tools-core-as : used when developing AS\nlogin/login                : used when developing IJ\nlogin/login-as             : used when developing AS\nct4as/cloud-tools          : used when developing AS\n\nI may change \"cloud-tools\" to also have 2 versions and be named something more AS specific, but that change isn\u0027t needed yet.",
